      "shortDescription": "The last-bench classic, rebuilt as a precision flick duel.",
      "description": [
        "Every classroom had one: two pens, one desk and a duel decided by a single flick. Pen Fight turns that last-bench ritual into a precision physics game.",
        "Read the angle, commit the flick and knock your rival off the desk before the bell rings. Every desk is an arena, and rulers, erasers and edges become terrain.",
        "Pass the desk to a friend for a local duel, or take it online."
      ],
      "features": [
        {
          "title": "Flick physics",
          "text": "Every flick is a read: angle, force and timing decide the duel."
        },
        {
          "title": "Desk arenas",
          "text": "Every desk tells a story. Rulers, erasers and edges become terrain."
        },
        {
          "title": "Local and online",
          "text": "Pass the desk to a friend, or take the duel online."
        }
