  "letter": {
    "big": "Players first. Long term. Every frame owned.",
    "to": "To players, partners and the creators who trust us with their worlds:",
    "before": [
      "India has one of the largest player bases on earth, and it has yet to ship a global hit. We don't think that is a talent problem. It is a design problem, a cost problem and a patience problem. Gattabara Games exists to solve all three.",
      "We make decisions differently from most studios, so it is worth writing down how:"
    ],
    "principles": [
      {
        "title": "We start with the player and work backwards.",
        "text": "Feel is decided in greybox, before art and before marketing. If a mechanic doesn't feel right with boxes, it won't feel right with polish."
      },
      {
        "title": "We play the long game.",
        "text": "We will turn down revenue that dilutes an IP, and accept short-term cost when it compounds into a better game."
      },
      {
        "title": "We spend like owners.",
        "text": "Every rupee is either on screen or making what is on screen better. A small core, an on-call roster and no idle bench."
      },
      {
        "title": "Every frame has a name behind it.",
        "text": "Each system, scene and line of code has one owner. Authorship creates accountability."
      },
      {
        "title": "We decide fast and correct fast.",
        "text": "Most decisions can be reversed, so we make them with the information we have and fix them in the next build. The few that can't be reversed, we make slowly."
      },
      {
        "title": "Our games and our services feed each other.",
        "text": "Every world we build surfaces new talent, and that talent becomes the roster our partners hire."
      }
    ],
    "after": [
      "We will make mistakes. When we do, we will say so, fix them and keep the bar where it is.",
      "Our measure is simple. When a player has one free evening, do they choose our world? Everything else is detail.",
      "We are early. We think that is an advantage."
    ],
    "signature": "The Founding Partners",
    "signatureLine": "Gattabara Games LLP \u00b7 Bengaluru \u00b7 October 2026"
